    id: 'trust-and-receipts',
    title: 'Trust, gates, evidence, and receipts',
    summary:
      "Station presents Flow verdicts, Veritas readiness and Surface trust bundles through their owners' contracts, alongside its own execution records. Missing evidence and source authority remain explicit.",
